\Rightarrow a_{n+1} - \frac{1}{2}a_n = \frac{2}{(n+1)^2} - \frac{1}{n^2}
n = 1 \Rightarrow a_2 - \frac{1}{2}a_1 = \frac{2}{2^2} - \frac{1}{1^2}
2\left[a_3 - \frac{1}{2}a_2 = \frac{2}{3^2} - \frac{1}{2^2}\right]
